		'quality' => 'We would rather run two platforms well than six poorly. Paid social is recommended when there is an audience and a destination, not as a default add-on. A month is planned before it is designed, and a post that does not match the website is revised or dropped. Community rules are written down so a reply does not depend on whoever happens to see the notification.',
		'related' => array('content-marketing', 'digital-marketing', 'google-ads'),
