			array('q' => 'What should a social program change?', 'a' => 'It should make the offer easier to recognise and give a person a next step that matches the website. A full calendar with no destination is not the goal.'),
			array('q' => 'Will you manage comments?', 'a' => 'We can define the rules and handle an agreed window. Sensitive replies should still have a person inside your company who can speak for it.'),
