		'title' => 'Content that makes the website and the sales conversation clearer.',
		'eyebrow' => 'Market',
		'card' => 'Strategy, website copy, thought leadership, and a way to reuse what you publish.',
		'intro' => 'Content strategy services start from the questions sales already hears. Sovassa plans and writes the pages and articles that answer them. An SEO content strategy is part of that work when search is how the questions arrive, not a separate publishing calendar.',
		'detail' => array(
			'Each piece has a page to support or a conversation to shorten. Website copy, a short article, and a note sales can send may be the same point in three forms. We do not start a blog because a calendar has empty weeks.',
